  "title": "Zesty Smoky Ethiopian Grape Leaves Stew",
  "description": "A tangy and crumbly Ethiopian dish featuring grape leaves, smoke-cold, and egg-free-friendly ingredients, perfect for a hangover cure. This stew is a unique blend of flavors and textures.",
