  "instructions": [
    "Heat the oil in a large pot over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion and saute until softened, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the minced garlic and cook for 1 minute, until fragrant.",
    "Add the berbere spice, smoked paprika, salt, and black pepper, and stir to combine.",
    "Add the tomato paste and stir to combine, cooking for 1 minute.",
    "Add the grape leaves, lemon juice, and 2 cups of water, and bring to a boil.",
    "Reduce the heat to low and simmer, covered, for 20 minutes.",
    "Serve hot, garnished with additional lemon juice and smoked paprika, if desired."
